\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev5.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13500 (20 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using ```Quaternion(arc_from: Vector3, arc_to: Vector3)``` with Vector3.Up and Vector3.Down, gdscript produces a quaternion with (0, 0, -1, 0) and c# produces one with (0, 1, 0, 0) (which is wrong).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n - Use the ```Quaternion(arc_from: Vector3, arc_to: Vector3)``` constructor with Vector3.Up and Vector3.Down\n - Print the result\n - Repeat in the other language\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[quat.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20759306/quat.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107595/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107595/timeline","performed_via_gi